{"id":46122,"vol":{"id":5755,"name":"Nightwing"},"num":"37","name":"Escape from Blackgate - Escape to Blackgate, Part Three","title":"Nightwing #37","year":"1999","date":"1999-11-01","store":"1999-09-08","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/4/40872-5755-46122-1-nightwing.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/4/40872-5755-46122-1-nightwing.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"With Blackgate Prison flooding and dozens of murderous villains at his throat, Nightwing must complete the task of taking the penitentiary back from Lock-Up and his trustees. Even if he succeeds, he may be of no more use to Batman after what he's suffered at the hands of Blackgate's worst. \"Escape to Blackgate\" concludes.\n\nNightwing subdued the inmates at Blackgate and the Batman Family took control of the prison. Dick got safely to the Clocktower, where Barbara helped him out.","people":[{"id":41486,"name":"Chuck Dixon","role":"writer"},{"id":43255,"name":"Darren Vincenzo","role":"editor"},{"id":1806,"name":"Jamison","role":"colorist"},{"id":9421,"name":"John Costanza","role":"letterer"},{"id":51970,"name":"Joseph Illidge","role":"editor"},{"id":1516,"name":"Karl Story","role":"inker, cover"},{"id":44255,"name":"Roberta Tewes","role":"colorist"},{"id":2218,"name":"Scott McDaniel","role":"penciler, cover"}],"chars":[{"id":1691,"name":"Dick Grayson","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/9337371-nightwing-113-open-to-order-artist-spotlight-variant-lee.jpg"},{"id":5368,"name":"Barbara Gordon","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/1/15776/10071325-barbara_gordon.jpg"},{"id":3726,"name":"Scarecrow","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8135266-tumblr_b0e9b5e9433fcf268cc0a1ef6986e299_a07c97e4_1280.png"}],"arcs":[{"id":42106,"name":"\"Batman\" No Man's Land"}]}